cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the paper it belongs to. The archived
  snapshot itself has a DOI and is listed below under identifiers.
title: >-
  teacher-logit-scaling-kd: code, run manifests and pre-declaration records for
  teacher-side logit scaling in knowledge distillation
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, run manifests, frozen selection audit and dated pre-declaration
  records behind a study of how a teacher's calibration -- rather than its
  accuracy -- governs what a distilled student inherits, measured on RAF-DB and
  FERPlus. Every number printed in the paper is bound to an artifact field by a
  machine-checked ledger.
